'use strict';
// ================= CHROME FORCE -- the force talks back =================
// SF1's HQ let you talk to every member, and they had something new to say each chapter. Here: QUARTERMASTER > TALK.
// BANTER[id][ch] = the latest entry at or below the current chapter is used. TOWN_LATER changes street talk as a chapter's
// battles are won ([after 1-2 wins, after 3]). FATES are the end-credit lines.

